The family JetBrainsMono Nerd Font.
.TP
.I /usr/share/fonts/truetype/jetbrains-mono-nerd/JetBrainsMonoNerdFontMono\-*.ttf
The family JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono.
.TP
